# Hi, I'm Maxi 👋

I am an AI and computer science engineer with a background in Bioprocessinformatics (B.Sc., HSWT Freising) and hands-on experience in neural networks, machine learning, and Kubernetes infrastructure. I am currently working as a researcher at the University of the Bundeswehr Munich in the SPARTA project, with a focus on NLP.

